  'Melee / Reach': 'Melee = adjacent (Reach 2 = up to 2 spaces).',
  'Engaged': 'Adjacent to a living enemy. Automatic.',
  'Disengage': 'Moving away from an adjacent enemy is free (OPEN placeholder), so Disengage does nothing extra yet.',
  'Close Quarters': '-1 Attack with that ranged weapon while you are Engaged. OPEN.',
  'Slow': 'Weapon can\'t be used for extra attacks or multi-target power-ups.',
  'Thrown': 'Lands in the target\'s space; picked up automatically when you move into or next to it.',
  // ---- status ----
