  'Spell (face up / face down)': 'Cast it, it flips face down; all your face-down spells flip up at the start of your next turn. "Once per fight" spells stay down.',
  'Casting': 'Casting a spell is your action for the turn (instead of your normal attack). One spell per turn. Casters have no basic attack: they use their spells. OPEN.',
  'Spell Attack': '1d6 + Attack (+ Spell Attack bonuses) vs Toughness, Critical on a 6 that hits.',
  'Spell Check': '1d6 + Skill (+ Spell Check bonuses) vs 3 + target Resilience. OPEN.',
  'Reaction spell': 'Cast on another creature\'s turn when its trigger happens; no action, still flips face down.',
