  'Push / Pull N': 'Move the target up to N spaces straight away from / toward you; stops at creatures or the map edge.',
  'Overgrowth / Thorns / Fog': 'Terrain tokens. Overgrowth: enemies pay 2 Speed per space. Thorns: also 1 Damage the first time each turn an enemy enters or starts there. Fog: ranged attacks by or against a creature in it get -2 Attack.',
  'Snare': 'Trap token: the first enemy that moves into it takes 1 Damage and gets -1 Attack until the end of its next turn. One per Ranger.',
