// =====================================================================
// v1.5 CASTERS + HYBRIDS. Spell entries: spell: { kind, ... } (run by castSpell in app.js):
//   attack  = Spell Attack(s): range, atk, dmg, onHit ops, count/distinct, area (radius around a chosen enemy), line N, melee
//   check   = Spell Check vs 3 + Resilience: targets 'one' | 'adjacent' | 'within' (n) | 'area'; success ops
//   enemy   = no roll on one enemy in range; ally = you or a hero in range ('adj' = adjacent); allWithin = you + heroes within N
//   terrain = Overgrowth / Thorns / Fog around a chosen creature; snare; mark; shape; reaction; smite; strike
// "Once per fight" is read from the card text.
// =====================================================================
const ATK = (o) => ({ kind: 'attack', ...o });
// v1.10 USER RULE: every ranged weapon attack and every spell attack has Range 5 (CONFIG.range.default); the Longbow gives +5 (Range 10).
// The values below were rewritten to match; CONFIG.range is the source of truth and app.js re-applies it at load (applyRangeRule).
// ------------------------------------------------------------------ WIZARD (deck 4, Caster)
